{"id":51618,"date":"2026-06-11T07:45:13","date_gmt":"2026-06-11T06:45:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51618"},"modified":"2026-10-02T09:29:33","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T08:29:33","slug":"grande-premio-do-vale-grande","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-premio-do-vale-grande\/","title":{"rendered":"Grande Pr\u00e9mio do Vale Grande 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Grande Pr\u00e9mio do Vale Grande 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Grande Pr\u00e9mio do Vale Grande 2026<\/strong> (10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no feriado de <strong>5 de outubro de 2026<\/strong> na localidade da <strong>Pontinha<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Odivelas<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Promovido pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Vale Grande<\/strong> e pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Odivelas<\/strong>, com apoio dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios da Pontinha e organiza\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da <strong>WeRun<\/strong>, o evento comemora uma d\u00e9cada de tradi\u00e7\u00e3o com partida e meta instaladas na sede da associa\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A jornada desportiva arranca \u00e0s 09h00 com a jovem <strong>Corrida do Valentim<\/strong> (bambis a juvenis, gratuita), seguindo-se a <strong>Corrida 10 Km<\/strong> \u00e0s 09h45, a <strong>Corrida 5 Km<\/strong> \u00e0s 09h50 e a <strong>Caminhada 5 Km<\/strong> \u00e0s 09h55 (de participa\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita). O evento culmina com o famoso e tradicional conv\u00edvio gastron\u00f3mico com porco no espeto e bebida oferecido pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Vale Grande a todos os atletas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-sna